uelType','String','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT\r\nR2:VALUE IS PRESENT IF FuelType = \'D\'\r\nR3:VALUE IS ABSENT IF FuelType != \'D\'','N','0','admin',NULL,'',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx 且 FuelType = D 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）时必填\r\n\r\n当车型=Mx, Nx 且 FuelType not equal to D时禁止\r\n当车型=Lx, Ox, Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx时禁止','maxLength=10','26.2.',NULL,34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF','认证系统','47ce9cd0-68ed-42b3-806f-0b0bcede6306'),(2447,262,'EngineSpeedMaximumNetPowerMax','Int','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT','N','0','admin',NULL,'',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx, Lx for the EnergyConvertor with an EngineCapacity时必填\r\nand EngineSpeedMaximumNetPower has no value 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）, VEngineSpeedMaximumNetPowerMax > EngineSpeedMaximumNetPowerMin\r\n\r\n禁止 for the EnergyConvertor where EngineSpeedMaximumNetPower has a value\r\n当车型=Ox, Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx时禁止\r\n禁止 for the EnergyConvertor where EngineCapacity has no value','min=0.0; max=99999.0','27.1.',NULL,34,'VALUE IS PRESENT',NULL,'690f9412-be3a-410c-abb6-03ecf30c7f99'),(2448,263,'MaximumNetPowerElectric','Decimal','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT\r\nR2:VALUE IS PRESENT IF EnergySource = \'95\' AND Maximum30MinutesPower IS ABSENT AND ConsolidatedMaximumNetPowerElectric IS ABSENT\r\nR3:VALUE IS PRESENT IF EnergySource = \'95\'\r\nR4:VALUE IS ABSENT IF EnergySource != \'95\'','N','0','admin',NULL,'',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx 且 EnergySource = 95 且 no value specified in Maximum30MinutesPower 且 no value specified in ConsolidatedMaximumNetPowerElectric 且 StageOfCompletion= C 时必填\r\n\r\n当车型=Tx, Cx 且 EnergySource = 95 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）时必填\r\n\r\n禁止 where EnergySource <> 95\r\n当车型=Ox, Lx, Rx, Sx时禁止','totalDigits=6; fractionDigits=2; min=0.0; max=9999.99','27.3.','STRIP_UNIT',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF','认证系统','e5db898f-525e-4786-bfed-f92c289f1b1a'),(2449,264,'ConsolidatedMaximumNetPowerElectric','Decimal','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT\r\nVALUE IS ABSENT IF COUNT(EnergySource WITHIN [\'95\']) < 2','N','0','admin',NULL,'',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx with multiple 