fractionDigits=2; min=0.0; max=999.99','29.','STRIP_UNIT',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT','认证系统','b9106724-f0ff-4681-a365-2553e4d1f0bc'),(2460,275,'AxleTrack','Short','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT\r\nR2:VALUE-RANGE IS PRESENT\r\nR3:VALUE-RANGE IS VALID\r\nR4:VALUE <= COALESCE(Width, WidthAdjustableMax?)','N','0','admin',NULL,'',NULL,'当车型=Mx, N1x,Tx 且 AxleTrackAdjustableMin / AxleTrackAdjustableMax has no value 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）时必填\r\nAxleTrack < Width OR WidthAdjustableMax\r\n\r\n当车型=N2x, N3x, O3x, O4x时禁止\r\n当 AxleTrackAdjustableMin / AxleTrackAdjustableMax 有值时禁止','min=0.0; max=9999.0','30.','DIRECT',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT','认证系统','b4fbec4b-be9d-4498-be45-9bdab35f3a53'),(2461,276,'AxleTrackAdjustableMin','Short','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT','N','0','admin',NULL,'',NULL,'当车型=Mx, N1, Tx 且 AxleTrack has no value 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）时必填\r\nAxleTrackAdjustableMin < AxleTrackAdjustableMax\r\n\r\n当车型=N2x, N3x, O3x, O4x时禁止\r\n当 AxleTrack 有值时禁止','min=0.0; max=9999.0','30',NULL,34,'VALUE IS PRESENT',NULL,'f42d00a5-fcc1-466b-a579-5025da2e7363'),(2462,277,'AxleTrackAdjustableMax','Short','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT','N','0','admin',NULL,'',NULL,'当车型=Mx, N1, Tx 且 AxleTrackAdjustable has no value 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）时必填\r\nAxleTrackAdjustableMax > AxleTrackAdjustableMin\r\n\r\n当车型=N2x, N3x, O3x, O4x时禁止\r\n当 AxleTrackAdjustable 有值时禁止','min=0.0; max=9999.0','30.',NULL,34,'VALUE IS PRESENT',NULL,'7f6b3abb-0847-4f45-af34-804eb62a1021'),(2463,278,'TyreNumber','Short','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT','N','0','admin',NULL,'',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx, Ox, Lx, Tx, Rx, Sx 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）时必填\r\nValue must be sequential, starting with 1','min=0.0; max=999.0','35.',NULL,34,'VALUE IS PRESENT','认证系统','70a62ff6-e26d-4880-a7eb-e6fbeb85bf2d'),(2464,279,'TyreSize','String','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT','N','0','admin',NULL,'',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx, Ox, Lx, Tx, Rx, Sx 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）时必填','minLength=1; maxLength=20','35.','DIRECT',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT','认证系统','b4d7